{"id":"53caaf34d3e04e84","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-reachable.md","title":"Reachable Cardinal","display":"df-reachable — Reachable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-reachable","aliases":["58-df-reachable"],"display":"df-reachable — Reachable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-reachable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-reachable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reachable — Reachable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\lambda)\\)</span> is the power set from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reachable}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Reachable}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reachable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reachable}_S(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal P(\\lambda)|\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reachable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reachable}_S(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal P(\\lambda)|\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An infinite cardinal is reachable precisely when it is not strong limit: some smaller cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> already has <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\lambda\\geq\\kappa\">\\(2^\\lambda\\geq\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former elementary-substructure clause was a different and essentially Löwenheim--Skolem phenomenon.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P(\\lambda)$ is the power set from [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reachable}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reachable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reachable}_S(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal P(\\lambda)|\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\lambda\\geq\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1177,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1042","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-reachable.md|58-df-reachable]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","2b6b1d9eb78a2714","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}